1
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,000
What do you think you're doing, kid?

2
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,359
One streak of black, two streaks of black,

3
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,640
Three, four, five, six, seven streaks of black.

4
00:00:45,679 --> 00:00:47,840
The shopkeeper's diner is newly open,

5
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,960
Serving up heaps of delicious food!

6
00:00:50,039 --> 00:00:52,079
I sing a song, you spare a tip,

7
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:54,039
Customers stream in, one by one!

8
00:00:54,039 --> 00:00:55,799
The shopkeeper's diner is newly open,

9
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:56,520
Shopkeeper!

10
00:00:56,759 --> 00:00:57,719
A beggar is here!

11
00:00:57,759 --> 00:00:58,600
How many?

12
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,039
Just one.

13
00:00:59,039 --> 00:01:00,359
I sing a song, you spare a tip,

14
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:00,920
Just one?

15
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,039
Just ignore him.

16
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,479
Maybe you should go out and have a look.

17
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:06,200
Customers stream in, one by one!

18
00:01:08,359 --> 00:01:10,640
The shopkeeper's diner is newly open,

19
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,760
Serving up heaps of delicious food!

20
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,879
I sing a song, you spare a tip,

21
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:17,000
Customers stream in, one by one!

22
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:17,760
Shopkeeper!

23
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,000
Wishing you a grand opening!

24
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:46,519
He's bleeding!

25
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:47,319
He's bleeding!

26
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:47,760
What's going on?

27
00:01:53,439 --> 00:01:56,319
I bought an ebony pipe stem,

28
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:59,359
Grip both ends, one streak of black.

29
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:02,400
Second Miss paints her brows and trims her hair,

30
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:05,319
Peeks in the mirror, two streaks of black.

31
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:13,560
Write the character "chuan" on the front pillar,

32
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,879
Look from any side, three streaks of black.

33
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,360
Shopkeeper!

34
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,560
Happy grand opening!

35
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:17,560
Dad.

36
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,680
Let Dad take a look.

37
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,920
Tell me.

38
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,480
Does it hurt?

39
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,000
Dad, it doesn't hurt.

40
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:26,959
Good boy.

41
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:29,680
I didn't raise you for nothing.

42
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,560
Go on, eat your noodles.

43
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,720
In this world,

44
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:42,040
what father could look at his child

45
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,879
battered like this and not feel heartbroken?

46
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,399
Look at him, every last one of you!

47
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:47,839
Look at your brother!

48
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,199
That's a real man!

49
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:51,240
A real man's face has got to bleed!

50
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,079
Eat slowly.

51
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,639
You all want some?

52
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,360
Yes!

53
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,079
I do!

54
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:04,040
I want to eat!

55
00:05:04,399 --> 00:05:05,279
You want some?

56
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:06,759
Come here.

57
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:18,639
A real man has to be ruthless to himself!

58
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,879
Only by being ruthless can he make money!

59
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,920
And with money,

60
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,639
won't he have noodles to eat?

61
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:24,720
Don't wipe it!

62
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,759
Save it for when you sing at the Golden Pavilion!

63
00:05:30,279 --> 00:05:31,560
Come here, child.

64
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:38,600
Dad can only help you this far.

65
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,879
You'll have to walk the rest of the way yourself.

66
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:43,519
Stop crying.

67
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:44,759
Go on.

68
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,040
Go make some money.

69
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:47,040
Yes, Dad.

70
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,720
Make me proud!

71
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,240
Master

72
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:51,920
Go home

73
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:17,439
Master is back!

74
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,759
This way, Master.

75
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,959
Welcome, Gang Leader!

76
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,399
Boss...

77
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,600
Boss...

78
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:57,399
Your bath is ready.

79
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:57,639
Gouzi.

80
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,080
Boss!

81
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,679
You called?

82
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:09,039
What is this?

83
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:13,159
Boss,

84
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,679
when I poured the water in,

85
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:16,799
the bucket was completely clean.

86
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,200
I swear on my parents, I really do!

87
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:19,879
In the beginning,

88
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:21,159
there was nothing in this water.

89
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:22,240
Bullshit.

90
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,360
Do you even have parents?

91
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:31,840
These don't look like ordinary fish scales.

92
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,120
I've never seen such an oddity either.

93
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,200
Put it away for now.

94
00:09:39,519 --> 00:09:39,960
All right.

95
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:40,840
Wrap it up properly.

96
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,159
Right away, Boss!

97
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,679
Dad, I'm hungry.

98
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,519
Boss, this is the new batch.

99
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,080
Whose sweet baby is this?

100
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,919
Such beautiful eyes.

101
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,840
Gouge them out.

102
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,519
Later, Daddy will...

103
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,840
...give you a glass eye.

104
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,159
All nice and shiny.

105
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,159
No!

106
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,039
Be good.

107
00:11:00,559 --> 00:11:03,240
Daddy will get you a nice sled later, too.

108
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,799
So you can slide along, okay?

109
00:11:04,879 --> 00:11:05,759
No, please!

110
00:11:07,919 --> 00:11:09,080
Chop off his legs.

111
00:11:23,679 --> 00:11:24,320
Old Yang.

112
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,600
Why are these kids still here?

113
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,279
Third Master,

114
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:29,799
our tools are all rusted.

115
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:31,519
These kids all got infected.

116
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,679
Boss, look at this...

117
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,559
Such good tools—

118
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:37,320
why don't you take care of them?

119
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:38,320
If you kept them sharpened,

120
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,840
the kids wouldn't suffer as much.

121
00:11:40,759 --> 00:11:42,159
I'm telling you, if not for my father-in-law,

122
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:43,399
I wouldn't have hired you at all.

123
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,200
Begging and cooking—

124
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,159
they follow the exact same logic.

125
00:11:46,159 --> 00:11:47,440
Appealing to all the senses, right?

126
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,519
Hearing that you're miserable

127
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:49,639
is nothing compared to seeing it.

128
00:11:49,639 --> 00:11:51,240
Seeing how wretched you look, they should

129
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,039
feel it straight from the heart.

130
00:11:52,279 --> 00:11:54,000
What kind of mess did you make here?

131
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,799
Look, why hasn't this kid moved at all?

132
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:56,799
Is he dead?

133
00:11:56,799 --> 00:11:58,039
If he's dead, drag him out of here!

134
00:11:58,039 --> 00:11:59,120
The place reeks.

135
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,240
Come on,

136
00:12:00,279 --> 00:12:01,080
can't you give these kids

137
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:01,879
a decent,

138
00:12:01,879 --> 00:12:02,960
proper living environment?

139
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,360
Daddy, save me!

140
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,159
Shut up!

141
00:12:05,159 --> 00:12:06,240
Daddy, save me!

142
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,039
Get him out of here, now!

143
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:07,440
Yes, sir.

144
00:12:07,519 --> 00:12:08,200
Daddy!

145
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,879
Daddy, save me!

146
00:12:10,279 --> 00:12:11,120
Daddy!

147
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:12,440
Shut your mouth!

148
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,559
Open your mouth.

149
00:12:13,559 --> 00:12:14,639
Open it!

150
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,559
What are you doing?

151
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:16,240
Let him go!

152
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,000
Chief!

153
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,360
Daddy!

154
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,080
These bad people...

155
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:21,559
Come here.

156
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:26,120
Daddy, I don't want to drink the medicine.

157
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:28,279
Daddy knows.

158
00:12:28,559 --> 00:12:30,440
Daddy's doing this for your own good.

159
00:12:30,679 --> 00:12:31,720
Tell Daddy,

160
00:12:32,159 --> 00:12:33,919
do you want to use your mouth to talk,

161
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,360
or use it to eat meat?

162
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,759
Eat meat.

163
00:12:37,679 --> 00:12:39,320
That's Daddy's good boy.

164
00:12:40,799 --> 00:12:42,159
Drink this medicine,

165
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,840
and you'll get to eat meat every day.

166
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:47,120
You're such a strong boy.

167
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:50,440
One more sip.

168
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:51,720
The bravest boy.

169
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:52,320
Here you go.

170
00:12:56,679 --> 00:12:58,519
What a good boy you are.

171
00:13:01,039 --> 00:13:04,000
Nothing good comes from talking too much anyway.

172
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:06,120
Talking too much just makes you hungry.

173
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,519
Easy, easy!

174
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:19,840
Boss,

175
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,519
In everything you do,

176
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:27,200
it's all about method.

177
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,799
Cut out his tongue in a bit,

178
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:33,320
and take him to Qiongxian Teahouse tomorrow morning.

179
00:13:33,519 --> 00:13:35,879
That's where he'll work from now on.

180
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,000
Boss,

181
00:13:37,039 --> 00:13:38,120
why send him there?

182
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,600
Think about it.

183
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:43,559
You take your mistress to an opera,

184
00:13:43,879 --> 00:13:46,279
and you've just tipped the stage.

185
00:13:46,519 --> 00:13:47,559
Then you turn around and see

186
00:13:47,559 --> 00:13:50,279
such a cute, lovely little kid,

187
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:51,879
except he has no tongue,

188
00:13:51,879 --> 00:13:52,879
and can't speak at all.

189
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:54,080
If you don't toss him a few coins,

190
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,120
can you even call yourself human?

191
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:58,159
Boss, you truly are a genius.

192
00:13:58,159 --> 00:13:59,360
No wonder everyone says

193
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:02,399
sticking with you is the only way to get ahead.

194
00:14:02,399 --> 00:14:03,759
Cut the flattery

195
00:14:04,279 --> 00:14:05,480
and get to work.

196
00:14:06,159 --> 00:14:08,639
What brought me this far?

197
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,120
Two words.

198
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,440
Lucid.

199
00:14:11,879 --> 00:14:13,399
Supremely lucid.

200
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:16,399
I'm innocent!

201
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:20,120
You crook!

202
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,720
Swindler!

203
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:22,840
Listen here, Wu!

204
00:14:23,679 --> 00:14:24,840
Are you going to tell the truth?

205
00:14:25,039 --> 00:14:26,440
I'm really innocent!

206
00:14:26,759 --> 00:14:28,120
I've been framed!

207
00:14:30,519 --> 00:14:31,720
Shopkeeper Wu,

208
00:14:31,919 --> 00:14:34,360
if you don't come clean with me right now,

209
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:36,200
once Third Brother gets back,

210
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,360
you'll learn the hard way.

211
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,240
Third Master!

212
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,799
I'm truly being wronged!

213
00:14:45,799 --> 00:14:46,720
"Wronged," my foot!

214
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,960
Isn't this Shopkeeper Wu?

215
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:49,399
Darling...

216
00:14:49,399 --> 00:14:51,080
Why'd you beat him like this, darling?

217
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,039
Isn't there some misunderstanding?

218
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:54,039
Yes, yes, it's a misunderstanding, Big Brother!

219
00:14:54,039 --> 00:14:54,840
Misunderstanding, my ass!

220
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,399
Stop hitting him!

221
00:14:56,399 --> 00:14:57,879
He's my brother!

222
00:14:57,879 --> 00:14:59,799
Brother, my ass!

223
00:15:00,279 --> 00:15:01,879
He's just a con man!

224
00:15:01,919 --> 00:15:02,759
Brother San!

225
00:15:02,919 --> 00:15:05,120
You're getting older, not any wiser!

226
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,720
You never learn!

227
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:08,120
Just look at this!

228
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,759
All this junk you bought!

229
00:15:09,759 --> 00:15:11,519
Fake! It's all fake!

230
00:15:11,519 --> 00:15:13,039
Every single piece is a fake!

231
00:15:13,039 --> 00:15:14,480
He's a fraud!

232
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:16,000
Why can't you see it?!

233
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,120
And you're still defending him?!

234
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:19,240
Do you have rocks in your head?!

235
00:15:21,519 --> 00:15:22,759
Darling...

236
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:24,879
Calm down first, darling.

237
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:26,200
Haven't I always said...

238
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,360
...we should be magnanimous?

239
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,960
Shopkeeper Wu must have...

240
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,279
...been scammed by others before, too.

241
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,200
Besides, this time,

242
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,559
didn't we get that authoritative Master Lu

243
00:15:33,559 --> 00:15:35,240
to appraise them for us?

244
00:15:35,679 --> 00:15:37,519
They're genuine,

245
00:15:37,519 --> 00:15:39,440
authentic palace treasures!

246
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:40,720
Bullshit master!

247
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,120
That so-called master

248
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,759
is his cousin!

249
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:45,879
You absolute fool!

250
00:15:45,879 --> 00:15:47,519
I'm wasting my breath on you!

251
00:15:47,759 --> 00:15:48,519
Eunuch,

252
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,399
please explain it to him.

253
00:15:50,559 --> 00:15:52,279
I'm tired of talking and tired of beating him.

254
00:15:52,279 --> 00:15:53,960
I'm going to have some tea and rest.

255
00:15:54,519 --> 00:15:56,200
Idiot! You total moron!

256
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,879
Stop calling me a moron!

257
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,159
Chief Cao.

258
00:15:59,679 --> 00:16:00,240
Eunuch.

259
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:02,000
The wares Shopkeeper Wu sold you...

260
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,480
I have examined them thoroughly.

261
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,320
They are indeed fakes.

262
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,279
That can't be!

263
00:16:06,679 --> 00:16:07,440
Eunuch,

264
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,879
look, there's even a reign mark on the bottom!

265
00:16:11,159 --> 00:16:13,559
What does this reign mark say?

266
00:16:14,399 --> 00:16:17,320
See? "Made in the Hongwu Reign of the Great Ming"!

267
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:22,320
Back when this servant served

268
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:24,120
Emperor Guangxu in the palace,

269
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:27,519
I studied Ming porcelain in great depth.

270
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:28,600
Indeed,

271
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:33,559
every Ming reign bore reign marks,

272
00:16:33,559 --> 00:16:35,320
except during the Hongwu reign.

273
00:16:35,519 --> 00:16:36,879
The dynasty was newly founded,

274
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,279
thriving and ascendant.

275
00:16:38,399 --> 00:16:40,039
The porcelain back then

276
00:16:40,039 --> 00:16:42,720
imitated the styles of the Yuan Dynasty.

277
00:16:42,799 --> 00:16:43,799
Therefore...

278
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:45,960
...Hongwu porcelain...

279
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,679
...never has a reign mark!

280
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,480
But this has a mark...

281
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,360
Hongwu has no mark!

282
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:58,799
Eunuch,

283
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,919
Brother Wu and I

284
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,840
would like a word in private.

285
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:05,599
Please go back to your room for some tea.

286
00:17:05,599 --> 00:17:06,160
All right.

287
00:17:06,559 --> 00:17:07,319
Excuse me.

288
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:11,960
Third Master...

289
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,480
Is that Master Lu really your cousin?

290
00:17:18,039 --> 00:17:18,839
They say,

291
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:19,960
"Three times is the limit,"

292
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,519
yet this is your fifth!

293
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,279
Tell me,

294
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,400
"I gave my heart to the bright moon,

295
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,880
yet the moon chose to shine on a ditch."

296
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,279
Shopkeeper Wu, you have no respect for me.

297
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,319
Third Master, spare me!

298
00:17:36,319 --> 00:17:38,319
I'll give you back all your money!

299
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:39,799
Spare my life, please, Third Master!

300
00:17:39,799 --> 00:17:41,319
You'll return the money, of course.

301
00:17:42,279 --> 00:17:44,359
But that money was scammed.

302
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:45,480
It's dirty.

303
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,119
What do you mean?

304
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:49,079
Making money takes brains.

305
00:17:54,759 --> 00:17:55,680
Third Master!

306
00:17:59,599 --> 00:18:00,960
Third Master, don't do this!

307
00:18:01,319 --> 00:18:02,480
Please don't!

308
00:18:03,279 --> 00:18:04,119
Third Master!

309
00:18:10,279 --> 00:18:11,640
Bring that over to me.

310
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:15,279
Third Master.

311
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:17,880
Hold still.

312
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:24,759
Look, this look isn't bad at all.

313
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,599
With this look...

314
00:18:26,599 --> 00:18:28,599
even I want to give you money just looking at you.

315
00:18:33,559 --> 00:18:34,240
Brother Wu...

316
00:18:34,599 --> 00:18:36,039
From now on, you'll wear this on your head

317
00:18:36,359 --> 00:18:37,039
and go beg for money.

318
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,720
Thank you, Third Master.

319
00:18:39,279 --> 00:18:40,400
Thank you, Third Master!

320
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:43,519
Come here.

321
00:18:43,799 --> 00:18:44,599
Sew it on.

322
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:45,680
Third Master!

323
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,200
Please don't, Third Master!

324
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,000
Third Master, I was wrong!

325
00:18:55,519 --> 00:18:56,839
The "Past Life Fortune" con

326
00:18:56,839 --> 00:18:59,400
has long been lost to the underworld.

327
00:19:02,119 --> 00:19:04,000
Chengming pulled it off.

328
00:19:04,519 --> 00:19:05,640
Good job.

329
00:19:06,359 --> 00:19:07,240
Shangguan Chengming,

330
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,759
you ran a con for a brother,

331
00:19:09,079 --> 00:19:10,160
and I've got no problem with that.

332
00:19:10,319 --> 00:19:13,519
But if you lose money, the lodge won't cover it.

333
00:19:14,079 --> 00:19:16,119
I picked out a few good jobs for you.

334
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,319
Hear me out.

335
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,200
In Li Jiatuo south of the city,

336
00:19:20,279 --> 00:19:21,359
there's a household.

337
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:23,240
The man is forty-nine with no heir.

338
00:19:23,359 --> 00:19:25,279
His wife finally managed to get pregnant,

339
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,720
and he's asking around everywhere,

340
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:28,440
wanting to have a son.

341
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,759
Go write him a prescription,

342
00:19:29,799 --> 00:19:31,839
and you'll easily pocket a small gold bar.

343
00:19:31,839 --> 00:19:32,759
Too little.

344
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:41,880
A gold shop west of town wants to sell,

345
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,240
claiming bad feng shui.

346
00:19:43,519 --> 00:19:44,519
Go do a feng shui reading for them.

347
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,799
Too tiring.

348
00:19:47,559 --> 00:19:49,279
It's either too little or too tiring.

349
00:19:49,359 --> 00:19:50,359
What's your deal?

350
00:19:50,359 --> 00:19:52,319
Who hunts roe deer these days?

351
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:55,880
If you're hunting, go for a real tiger.

352
00:19:56,119 --> 00:19:58,000
And who's the real tiger?

353
00:20:01,759 --> 00:20:03,000
Cao San of the Beggar Gang.

354
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,440
This time,

355
00:20:11,799 --> 00:20:14,119
I'm lucky you appraised it for me, Eunuch.

356
00:20:14,119 --> 00:20:14,799
Otherwise,

357
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:16,599
that kid named Wu

358
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:17,559
would've totally scammed me.

359
00:20:18,079 --> 00:20:20,079
A toast to you, Eunuch!

360
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,519
Eunuch,

361
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,960
I must propose a toast to you too!

362
00:20:25,279 --> 00:20:27,279
We owe it all to you this time!

363
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,160
What are you doing?

364
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,680
If it weren't for the eunuch,

365
00:20:29,759 --> 00:20:30,759
this silly fool

366
00:20:30,759 --> 00:20:32,519
would've bought another pile of fakes!

367
00:20:32,559 --> 00:20:33,960
Cheers, bottoms up!

368
00:20:35,279 --> 00:20:37,319
Just think, in the imperial palace,

369
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,640
how could there be so many treasures?

370
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:41,480
Even if there were,

371
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,319
with all those royal relatives,

372
00:20:43,319 --> 00:20:44,319
how could they ever end up

373
00:20:44,319 --> 00:20:46,079
in the hands of a Beggar Gang chief?

374
00:20:46,079 --> 00:20:47,880
You didn't even use your head!

375
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:48,759
My dear,

376
00:20:48,759 --> 00:20:50,799
you just don't understand.

377
00:20:50,799 --> 00:20:53,680
Palace items are the real deal!

378
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,279
They mean nobility,

379
00:20:55,519 --> 00:20:56,720
they mean status!

380
00:20:56,799 --> 00:20:57,640
Sometime soon,

381
00:20:57,880 --> 00:21:00,480
I'll buy you a Nine Dragons and Phoenixes Crown.

382
00:21:00,599 --> 00:21:02,920
You'll look gorgeous wearing it!

383
00:21:04,319 --> 00:21:05,960
What wishful thinking!

384
00:21:06,279 --> 00:21:08,000
That's meant for an empress!

385
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:10,079
I wouldn't dare drink to that.

386
00:21:14,759 --> 00:21:15,359
Madam!

387
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,359
What is it?

388
00:21:21,599 --> 00:21:22,400
Eunuch,

389
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,680
let me toast you again.

390
00:21:23,839 --> 00:21:25,640
Please excuse me for a moment.

391
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:27,240
I have an urgent matter to handle.

392
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:31,920
You're causing trouble for me again!

393
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:34,440
I have to clean up your mess again!

394
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:35,680
You're so annoying!

395
00:21:36,279 --> 00:21:37,000
Let's go.

396
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,279
Move!

397
00:21:39,519 --> 00:21:40,839
Those without a prick...

398
00:21:40,839 --> 00:21:42,039
simply have no brains.

399
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:44,160
She's far from supremely lucid.

400
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:47,839
Eunuch,

401
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:48,920
have some food.

402
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:50,559
Try this.

403
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,640
Here, Eunuch.

404
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:53,640
Have some bull penis, it's the freshest.

405
00:21:54,079 --> 00:21:55,799
Here.

406
00:21:55,799 --> 00:21:56,279
Eunuch,

407
00:21:56,279 --> 00:21:57,480
you replenish what you eat.

408
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:01,480
Chief Cao,

409
00:22:01,559 --> 00:22:03,559
should I be thanking you?

410
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,839
No need to stand on ceremony!

411
00:22:07,279 --> 00:22:08,200
Eunuch,

412
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:10,519
there's another little item

413
00:22:10,519 --> 00:22:13,200
I must trouble you to appraise for me.

414
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:23,759
Eunuch,

415
00:22:24,039 --> 00:22:25,400
what kind of fish is this?

416
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,440
With such huge scales?

417
00:22:27,279 --> 00:22:28,279
Chief Cao,

418
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:29,559
where did this...

419
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,960
come from?

420
00:22:33,359 --> 00:22:34,160
Cao San...

421
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:35,359
is the chief of the Beggar Gang.

422
00:22:35,359 --> 00:22:36,720
We're all folk of the underworld.

423
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:37,839
Each minds their own business.

424
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:39,200
That's the rule of the underworld.

425
00:22:39,279 --> 00:22:40,880
Since we're all underworld folk,

426
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:43,039
you must've heard of Mutilation for begging.

427
00:22:43,039 --> 00:22:43,759
Of course.

428
00:22:44,119 --> 00:22:45,839
The Beggar Gang rounds up orphans,

429
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,759
slashes their skin with knives,

430
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:50,160
and grafts animal skins onto them,

431
00:22:50,359 --> 00:22:50,920
turning them...

432
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:52,720
into monstrous freaks,

433
00:22:53,279 --> 00:22:55,240
then tossing them onto the streets to beg and perform.

434
00:22:55,599 --> 00:22:56,640
All these years,

435
00:22:57,279 --> 00:22:58,839
Cao San used this vile method

436
00:22:59,039 --> 00:23:00,400
to amass a fortune.

437
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:03,359
Shouldn't our Heavenly Fate Sect

438
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:04,799
act in Heaven's name,

439
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:06,160
robbing the rich to help the poor?

440
00:23:06,279 --> 00:23:09,720
Cao San is notorious for devouring people alive,

441
00:23:09,759 --> 00:23:12,200
and has hundreds of men under his command.

442
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:13,880
How do you plan to run a con on him?

443
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:14,519
What?

444
00:23:15,079 --> 00:23:16,160
Cold feet already?

445
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:18,160
Shangguan,

446
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:20,160
you're way too cocky!

447
00:23:21,559 --> 00:23:24,480
Cao San may well be a fierce tiger,

448
00:23:25,279 --> 00:23:26,440
but he can be hunted.

449
00:23:27,559 --> 00:23:28,240
Boss,

450
00:23:28,519 --> 00:23:29,799
that's Cao San we're talking about!

451
00:23:30,079 --> 00:23:31,400
It's settled.

452
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:41,240
Shangguan Chengming wants to run a con on Cao San.

453
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:43,920
He's clearly trying to drag our Heavenly Fate Sect down!

454
00:23:44,599 --> 00:23:47,519
Yet the Grandmaster ordered us all to back him up.

455
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,000
Third Brother,

456
00:23:50,559 --> 00:23:53,240
if this scheme falls through,

457
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:55,119
won't we take the fall with him?

458
00:23:55,359 --> 00:23:58,160
The branch leaders might look down on him,

459
00:23:58,799 --> 00:24:00,920
but the Grandmaster seems quite fond of the kid.

460
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:05,519
If peace reigned across our ranks,

461
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:08,319
the Grandmaster would never notice our worth.

462
00:24:13,119 --> 00:24:14,039
Third Brother,

463
00:24:14,279 --> 00:24:16,000
with skills like yours,

464
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:18,119
you rival the Grandmaster himself.

465
00:24:19,279 --> 00:24:20,759
Keep that kind of talk to yourself from now on.

466
00:24:20,920 --> 00:24:22,319
Just kidding around.

467
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,359
Old Seven,

468
00:24:24,559 --> 00:24:27,920
you and I must protect ourselves in this con.

469
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:31,400
If it succeeds, we take the credit.

470
00:24:32,079 --> 00:24:34,039
If it falls apart,

471
00:24:36,680 --> 00:24:38,200
we'll muddy the waters...

472
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:41,079
even further.

473
00:24:43,519 --> 00:24:44,839
You mean back then,

474
00:24:45,079 --> 00:24:48,559
Shangguan Chengming left Pangzhou around age ten?

475
00:24:49,039 --> 00:24:49,799
Yes.

476
00:24:51,359 --> 00:24:52,799
Villagers said

477
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:56,240
Hongmei sent the boy away to school alone back then.

478
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:59,319
He only returned once a year for the holidays,

479
00:24:59,559 --> 00:25:00,680
until one day,

480
00:25:00,799 --> 00:25:02,640
Hongmei left the village,

481
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:05,440
and no one ever saw the mother and son again.

482
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:10,359
Head down to Pangzhou

483
00:25:11,359 --> 00:25:13,240
and track down where she's been all these years.

484
00:25:13,559 --> 00:25:14,960
The more details, the better.

485
00:25:15,240 --> 00:25:16,640
I'll head back to pack,

486
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:17,799
and set off first thing tomorrow.

487
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:31,440
Boss.

488
00:25:33,119 --> 00:25:34,640
Are we really going after Cao San?

489
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,240
First it was the Plum Blossom Society,

490
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,559
then Fan Jialie,

491
00:25:38,559 --> 00:25:40,119
and now we're targeting Cao San.

492
00:25:40,720 --> 00:25:41,920
The way I see it, this Shangguan

493
00:25:42,079 --> 00:25:43,640
isn't trying to run a con on them,

494
00:25:43,720 --> 00:25:45,319
but treating us like roe deer.

495
00:25:45,799 --> 00:25:46,720
Liuzi.

496
00:25:48,119 --> 00:25:48,720
Come here.

497
00:25:49,039 --> 00:25:50,240
Let me ask you something.

498
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:51,880
Who's the roe deer?

499
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:53,440
Who's the tiger?

500
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,720
Let me tell you.

501
00:25:59,359 --> 00:26:02,440
A true master doesn't hunt the roe deer,

502
00:26:02,559 --> 00:26:04,799
but the tiger stalking behind it.

503
00:26:08,119 --> 00:26:09,640
What we need to do

504
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:11,799
is use Cao San as the roe deer

505
00:26:11,799 --> 00:26:13,799
to feed the tiger behind him,

506
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:17,000
and earn ourselves a favor.

507
00:26:17,960 --> 00:26:19,119
Whose favor?

508
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:22,400
Guess.

509
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:31,720
I remember locking the door.

510
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,559
You did.

511
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:36,440
Looks like picking locks and breaking in

512
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,519
is second nature to you.

513
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,519
I might not be as skilled as you,

514
00:26:40,720 --> 00:26:42,359
but I'm definitely bolder.

515
00:26:42,559 --> 00:26:44,480
If Yanzi hadn't specifically asked me,

516
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:47,039
I wouldn't even bother with you.

517
00:26:49,519 --> 00:26:50,920
Which ones are imperial kiln wares?

518
00:26:51,279 --> 00:26:52,599
Everything in front of you.

519
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:54,359
How much for this one?

520
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,720
One small gold bar.

521
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:02,960
What about this?

522
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:04,880
Ten silver dollars.

523
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:07,200
The craftsmanship is pretty mediocre.

524
00:27:08,759 --> 00:27:10,319
If you're here to pick a fight,

525
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:12,359
you know where the door is.

526
00:27:13,079 --> 00:27:14,240
You really expect

527
00:27:14,359 --> 00:27:16,480
me to fool the Beggar Gang's chief with these?

528
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:18,599
Then turn left outside the door

529
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:19,680
and go buy real ones.

530
00:27:20,799 --> 00:27:21,799
Let me tell you,

531
00:27:21,799 --> 00:27:24,000
there are plenty of experts in the Beggar Gang.

532
00:27:24,039 --> 00:27:24,559
You'd better

533
00:27:24,799 --> 00:27:26,200
not count on them falling for a fake.

534
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:28,480
I'll take everything from earlier.

535
00:27:30,839 --> 00:27:32,599
I want this one too.

536
00:27:32,599 --> 00:27:33,559
Put that down. Don't touch it.

537
00:27:34,079 --> 00:27:35,160
That one's real.

538
00:27:35,160 --> 00:27:36,279
Authentic Ming dynasty imperial kiln.

539
00:27:36,319 --> 00:27:37,599
You said it yourself,

540
00:27:37,599 --> 00:27:39,240
there are sharp eyes in the Beggar Gang.

541
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:41,160
If I don't have some authentic treasures on hand

542
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:42,079
and everything is fake,

543
00:27:42,079 --> 00:27:43,400
how am I supposed to hook Cao San?

544
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,880
Don't give me that nonsense.

545
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:46,759
Selling fakes is running a con.

546
00:27:47,039 --> 00:27:49,200
Selling real ones is doing business.

547
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:50,440
Don't worry.

548
00:27:50,799 --> 00:27:53,400
I promise to bring it back in one piece.

549
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:55,160
Besides, you'll be there on-site too.

550
00:27:55,279 --> 00:27:56,359
If you don't trust me,

551
00:27:56,759 --> 00:27:58,359
just keep a close eye on it yourself.

552
00:28:06,119 --> 00:28:07,279
This is good.

553
00:28:08,559 --> 00:28:10,640
You can even replicate stuff from the Forbidden City?

554
00:28:13,839 --> 00:28:15,160
Ten small gold bars.

555
00:28:15,599 --> 00:28:16,599
Paid upfront.

556
00:28:16,839 --> 00:28:19,160
Our lodge never pays upfront when running a con.

557
00:28:19,839 --> 00:28:20,880
Your con

558
00:28:21,519 --> 00:28:22,440
is different.

559
00:28:23,559 --> 00:28:25,000
Paying upfront is fine,

560
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:27,440
but you have to lend me that Xuande jar.

561
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:28,400
Fine.

562
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:29,720
It'll cost extra.

563
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,839
100 small gold bars.

564
00:28:53,519 --> 00:28:55,640
Dragon-Soaring General wins!

565
00:28:57,279 --> 00:28:58,519
This cricket of yours...

566
00:28:58,519 --> 00:29:00,200
Why does it look so grubby?

567
00:29:00,240 --> 00:29:01,519
Did you just dig it out

568
00:29:01,519 --> 00:29:02,759
from under the kitchen stove?

569
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:05,839
How could it ever compete with my general?

570
00:29:05,839 --> 00:29:07,240
Take it back and feed it to the chickens!

571
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:10,680
Feed it to the chickens!

572
00:29:12,279 --> 00:29:14,160
Bring me my Chishui General!

573
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,799
Collect it.

574
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:40,440
Don't leave yet!

575
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:44,279
Here are your silver dollars. Please take them.

576
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:47,279
You have great luck, miss.

577
00:29:47,519 --> 00:29:48,880
And an even sharper eye.

578
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:54,039
It's all thanks to you.

579
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:56,400
How should I address you, miss?

580
00:29:57,039 --> 00:30:00,000
Your accent doesn't sound local.

581
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,279
I just arrived in town.

582
00:30:03,400 --> 00:30:05,319
My surname is Jiang.

583
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:06,680
The name is Cao.

584
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:08,920
Where are you from, Miss Jiang?

585
00:30:10,559 --> 00:30:11,440
The north.

586
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:13,559
The north?

587
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:17,400
Would Miss Jiang do me the honor...

588
00:30:17,599 --> 00:30:18,920
...of joining me for a meal?

589
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:20,200
Just to make friends.

590
00:30:20,279 --> 00:30:21,359
Unfortunately,

591
00:30:21,480 --> 00:30:22,839
I have urgent business to attend to.

592
00:30:23,279 --> 00:30:24,240
Farewell.

593
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,119
Miss Jiang,

594
00:30:26,519 --> 00:30:28,359
what urgent business could that be?

595
00:30:28,640 --> 00:30:29,559
Not to brag,

596
00:30:29,559 --> 00:30:30,799
but in this neck of the woods,

597
00:30:30,799 --> 00:30:32,799
there's nothing Cao San can't handle.

598
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:33,640
See that?

599
00:30:33,799 --> 00:30:35,640
That's what my boss is capable of!

600
00:30:37,799 --> 00:30:39,920
I wonder if Boss Cao's Dragon-Soaring General...

601
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:41,119
...is for sale?

602
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,440
Miss Jiang,

603
00:30:47,799 --> 00:30:49,960
that's an undefeated champion.

604
00:30:50,079 --> 00:30:52,279
Honestly, it's dearer to me than my own son.

605
00:30:52,359 --> 00:30:53,599
Miss Jiang, please...

606
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,400
...don't part a man from what he loves.

607
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,559
Never mind, then.

608
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,119
Miss Jiang,

609
00:31:00,759 --> 00:31:01,680
I wonder,

610
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:04,480
why are you so set on buying my general?

611
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:07,319
Boss Cao,

612
00:31:07,759 --> 00:31:08,759
to be honest with you,

613
00:31:09,119 --> 00:31:11,440
I've always loved cricket fighting.

614
00:31:11,720 --> 00:31:13,440
My Little Swallow,

615
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:15,000
just like your general,

616
00:31:15,279 --> 00:31:16,960
was an undefeated champion.

617
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:19,359
But unexpectedly,

618
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,200
it was bitten to death yesterday.

619
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:24,119
That's such a shame.

620
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:26,359
Otherwise, my general

621
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:27,799
and your Little Swallow

622
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:29,799
would have made a perfect pair.

623
00:31:30,079 --> 00:31:31,039
That's why

624
00:31:31,240 --> 00:31:33,079
I must find the fiercest cricket

625
00:31:33,559 --> 00:31:35,279
to defeat Fifth Master's

626
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:37,119
Grand Marshal Tianbao.

627
00:31:37,319 --> 00:31:38,079
Fifth Master?

628
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:39,640
Which Fifth Master?

629
00:31:42,480 --> 00:31:43,880
Also...

630
00:31:44,559 --> 00:31:45,680
...from the north.

631
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:49,839
How about this?

632
00:31:49,839 --> 00:31:51,920
Though my general isn't for sale,

633
00:31:52,160 --> 00:31:53,720
if...

634
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:56,920
...Miss Jiang asks,

635
00:31:57,559 --> 00:31:59,559
I'd be willing to lend it to you.

636
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:06,720
Brother,

637
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:07,839
I'm so nervous.

638
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,400
I'm shaking from head to toe.

639
00:32:09,440 --> 00:32:10,400
Brother Liang,

640
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,440
take a deep breath.

641
00:32:13,039 --> 00:32:14,519
You finally get to play the lead role.

642
00:32:14,839 --> 00:32:16,119
Don't screw this up for me now.

643
00:32:16,200 --> 00:32:16,920
Wait,

644
00:32:17,319 --> 00:32:18,640
do you really think I can do this?

645
00:32:18,759 --> 00:32:20,000
Aside from you,

646
00:32:20,400 --> 00:32:21,559
nobody else could pull it off.

647
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:25,799
Stay calm.

648
00:32:36,039 --> 00:32:36,799
What are you doing?

649
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:38,559
Sir.

650
00:32:38,559 --> 00:32:39,720
What do you mean?

651
00:32:45,119 --> 00:32:45,960
Just wait.

652
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:53,200
Boss Cao.

653
00:32:54,039 --> 00:32:54,519
Come on in.

654
00:32:54,680 --> 00:32:55,640
Hello, Miss Jiang.

655
00:32:55,680 --> 00:32:56,400
Hello.

656
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:04,200
Boss Cao...

657
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,119
This is...

658
00:33:05,319 --> 00:33:06,599
They're all familiar faces.

659
00:33:06,599 --> 00:33:07,759
No need to be so formal.

660
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:08,960
Just relax.

661
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:10,880
Miss Jiang.

662
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,640
Boss Zhao.

663
00:33:13,559 --> 00:33:14,279
A pleasure to meet you.

664
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:26,440
Master Kui.

665
00:33:27,200 --> 00:33:29,079
This must be your Mighty Celestial Dragon.

666
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,039
I just can't keep my hands off it.

667
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:38,079
Back then, President Cao Kun of our Cao clan

668
00:33:38,279 --> 00:33:40,839
stayed right here at Yuzhong Mansion.

669
00:33:42,079 --> 00:33:42,720
Miss Jiang,

670
00:33:43,279 --> 00:33:44,680
forgive my intrusion,

671
00:33:45,839 --> 00:33:47,440
but what is your line of work?

672
00:33:48,559 --> 00:33:50,799
Oh, I don't work at all.

673
00:33:51,640 --> 00:33:53,200
I just live to have some fun.

674
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:02,599
Boss Cao,

675
00:34:02,960 --> 00:34:03,920
what are you looking at?

676
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:06,079
Look at the jar in that man's hand.

677
00:34:06,079 --> 00:34:07,880
That's crafted by Zhao Ziyu.

678
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:09,880
A rare treasure from the former dynasty.

679
00:34:10,159 --> 00:34:12,679
Seems Boss Cao truly has an eye for quality.

680
00:34:13,960 --> 00:34:16,239
That gentleman is Master Kui.

681
00:34:16,519 --> 00:34:17,679
He came from Beiping.

682
00:34:17,800 --> 00:34:18,559
His family...

683
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:21,079
served in the imperial palace for generations.

684
00:34:23,119 --> 00:34:24,440
Plain White Banner.

685
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:27,000
Plain White Banner!

686
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:28,960
Lingyu.

687
00:34:30,079 --> 00:34:30,880
Master Kui.

688
00:34:31,519 --> 00:34:32,280
My respects to you.

689
00:34:32,360 --> 00:34:33,480
All right, then.

690
00:34:35,039 --> 00:34:36,119
And who might this be?

691
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:38,480
This is Boss Cao.

692
00:34:38,639 --> 00:34:39,559
And this is Master Kui.

693
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:42,280
Master Kui.

694
00:34:45,639 --> 00:34:46,159
Lingyu,

695
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:47,880
you went out for a stroll.

696
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:49,480
Did you find any treasures?

697
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:51,760
No use asking, really.

698
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:53,119
I told you long ago,

699
00:34:53,159 --> 00:34:56,000
what good stuff could a small place like this have?

700
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:57,199
Later on,

701
00:34:57,599 --> 00:34:59,199
I'll let my Mighty Celestial Dragon

702
00:34:59,199 --> 00:35:00,679
avenge your Little Swallow.

703
00:35:00,920 --> 00:35:01,920
Thank you, Master Kui.

704
00:35:02,119 --> 00:35:03,440
Believe it or not,

705
00:35:03,440 --> 00:35:04,320
I actually...

706
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:06,320
managed to pick up a real treasure.

707
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:07,480
Really?

708
00:35:07,599 --> 00:35:08,320
Have a look.

709
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:12,719
This is Boss Cao's Dragon-Soaring General.

710
00:35:12,840 --> 00:35:14,159
I've seen it in action.

711
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:15,840
It fought and conquered all who challenged it;

712
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:17,159
I've never seen it lose a match.

713
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:18,639
It's truly formidable!

714
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:19,880
Is that so?

715
00:35:20,360 --> 00:35:21,360
Master Kui!

716
00:35:23,280 --> 00:35:24,920
I knew you'd be here.

717
00:35:25,239 --> 00:35:26,000
Beyond the Pass...

718
00:35:26,199 --> 00:35:27,960
A letter arrived for you from beyond the Pass.

719
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:32,559
Beyond the Pass, eh?

720
00:35:32,639 --> 00:35:33,280
He says...

721
00:35:36,159 --> 00:35:36,800
Miss Jiang.

722
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:38,280
Boss Guo.

723
00:35:39,079 --> 00:35:40,599
Boss Cao, please feel free to look around.

724
00:35:40,679 --> 00:35:41,440
I'll go say hello.

725
00:35:41,679 --> 00:35:42,039
Sure.

726
00:35:42,039 --> 00:35:42,800
Go ahead.

727
00:35:52,239 --> 00:35:52,840
Brother Liang,

728
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:54,880
hand me my jacket.

729
00:36:03,639 --> 00:36:04,880
Still dawdling here?

730
00:36:05,679 --> 00:36:07,280
When are you planning to make your entrance?

731
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:09,960
Just wait a little longer.

732
00:36:12,719 --> 00:36:14,000
You better think this through.

733
00:36:14,119 --> 00:36:15,519
It's not too late to back out now.

734
00:36:15,639 --> 00:36:17,159
Once I step through that door,

735
00:36:17,719 --> 00:36:19,320
these ten small gold bars...

736
00:36:19,719 --> 00:36:21,719
will be handed over for good.

737
00:36:24,559 --> 00:36:25,920
You don't trust me?

738
00:36:28,840 --> 00:36:31,000
Anyway, this Cao San is bad news.

739
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,119
In the past,

740
00:36:32,119 --> 00:36:34,119
someone swindled a lot of money from him with fake antiques.

741
00:36:34,559 --> 00:36:35,920
Later, those people...

742
00:36:36,039 --> 00:36:37,280
were subjected to Mutilation for begging.

743
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:37,960
I know that.

744
00:36:38,280 --> 00:36:39,559
No matter what you sell him,

745
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:41,559
he'll have experts inspect it.

746
00:36:42,039 --> 00:36:43,760
He won't act without seeing the prize.

747
00:36:45,119 --> 00:36:46,000
So?

748
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:48,039
What do you plan to sell him?

749
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:52,079
A sweet dream.

750
00:37:06,639 --> 00:37:07,719
Blessings to you.

751
00:37:08,119 --> 00:37:09,320
What era do you think this is?

752
00:37:09,559 --> 00:37:10,719
Still using those old courtesies?

753
00:37:11,199 --> 00:37:12,119
Rise.

754
00:37:13,480 --> 00:37:15,840
In your presence, no courtesy is too grand.

755
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:16,639
Please.

756
00:37:20,119 --> 00:37:20,960
Boss Cao.

757
00:37:21,639 --> 00:37:22,519
Miss Jiang.

758
00:37:24,039 --> 00:37:25,199
And who might this be?

759
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:27,800
A toast to you.

760
00:37:29,079 --> 00:37:30,360
I can only tell you...

761
00:37:32,039 --> 00:37:33,639
his surname is Aisin Gioro.

762
00:37:34,159 --> 00:37:35,159
His brother...

763
00:37:36,199 --> 00:37:37,599
is the one beyond the Pass.

764
00:37:39,039 --> 00:37:40,320
My god!

765
00:37:42,239 --> 00:37:42,840
Tell you what.

766
00:37:43,199 --> 00:37:45,400
I'll introduce Boss Cao to him.

767
00:37:47,039 --> 00:37:48,519
How should I address him?

768
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:49,760
Just call him Fifth Master.

769
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:51,199
Fifth Master.

770
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:52,199
Fifth Master.

771
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:54,800
Blessings to you, Fifth Master.

772
00:37:55,519 --> 00:37:57,639
This is Boss Cao.

773
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:02,000
So this is...

774
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:03,639
that master you spoke of?

775
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:04,920
Replying to Fifth Master,

776
00:38:05,119 --> 00:38:06,000
that is he.

777
00:38:12,719 --> 00:38:13,480
Boss Cao.

778
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:15,280
Boss Cao.

779
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,199
Blessings to you, Fifth Master.

780
00:38:23,719 --> 00:38:25,159
You're interested in this?

781
00:38:25,199 --> 00:38:26,280
I sure am!

782
00:38:26,280 --> 00:38:27,400
Isn't this a Xuande jar?

783
00:38:27,519 --> 00:38:29,360
I'd only ever heard of them, never seen one.

784
00:38:29,559 --> 00:38:31,239
Today my eyes have truly been opened.

785
00:38:31,639 --> 00:38:32,599
Hold this for me.

786
00:38:34,400 --> 00:38:35,639
Since you're already here,

787
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,280
let's have some proper fun.

788
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:39,440
Absolutely, absolutely.

789
00:38:39,559 --> 00:38:40,400
How about...

790
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:42,039
we let the two of them...

791
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:44,199
fight?

792
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:45,639
Let them fight?

793
00:38:46,360 --> 00:38:47,000
Fight.

794
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:47,880
Fight.

795
00:38:55,320 --> 00:38:55,920
Boss Cao,

796
00:38:56,599 --> 00:38:57,519
please place your bet.

797
00:38:59,719 --> 00:39:00,440
Fifth Master,

798
00:39:01,079 --> 00:39:02,039
how much should we wager?

799
00:39:02,679 --> 00:39:03,679
It's up to you.

800
00:39:03,920 --> 00:39:05,079
A modest bet for fun.

801
00:39:05,840 --> 00:39:06,760
Let's say...

802
00:39:06,880 --> 00:39:08,000
ten.

803
00:39:09,400 --> 00:39:10,599
Ten what?

804
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:13,840
Fingers?

805
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:17,639
Did this guy come from the sticks?

806
00:39:19,199 --> 00:39:20,840
May I ask, Boss Cao,

807
00:39:21,239 --> 00:39:23,239
what stakes do you usually play for?

808
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:25,480
I usually play for ten silver dollars.

809
00:39:30,719 --> 00:39:32,440
Ten silver dollars?

810
00:39:33,800 --> 00:39:34,599
Put it this way.

811
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:36,840
Those ten silver dollars...

812
00:39:37,159 --> 00:39:38,840
wouldn't even cover Mighty Celestial Dragon's

813
00:39:38,960 --> 00:39:40,480
food for a single day.

814
00:39:42,039 --> 00:39:43,239
Around here,

815
00:39:44,599 --> 00:39:46,400
it starts at ten small gold bars.

816
00:39:49,599 --> 00:39:52,239
Ten small gold bars are nothing.

817
00:39:52,519 --> 00:39:54,280
Why don't we just get started?

818
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:55,960
If I really lose,

819
00:39:56,239 --> 00:39:57,960
you can come home with me to collect them.

820
00:40:00,519 --> 00:40:03,960
That's never been the rule, has it?

821
00:40:04,880 --> 00:40:05,440
How about this:

822
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:06,519
why don't you...

823
00:40:07,039 --> 00:40:09,559
go home and fetch the cash first,

824
00:40:09,760 --> 00:40:11,320
and then we can play?

825
00:40:11,960 --> 00:40:13,400
What's the rush, Master Kui?

826
00:40:15,719 --> 00:40:17,280
Isn't it already here?

827
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,960
Miss Jiang, what is this...?

828
00:40:26,199 --> 00:40:27,159
Boss Cao...

829
00:40:27,519 --> 00:40:29,239
lent me his prized possession,

830
00:40:29,400 --> 00:40:31,280
and I'm not unreasonable.

831
00:40:31,400 --> 00:40:32,039
How about this:

832
00:40:32,639 --> 00:40:34,400
if we win, we split it fifty-fifty.

833
00:40:34,679 --> 00:40:35,400
If we lose,

834
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:36,719
it's all on me.

835
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:38,239
Miss Jiang,

836
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:39,800
how generous!

837
00:40:40,079 --> 00:40:42,199
I, Cao San, am also supremely lucid.

838
00:40:42,360 --> 00:40:44,119
How could I be petty and calculating?

839
00:40:44,400 --> 00:40:46,679
Win or lose, we split it down the middle!

840
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,039
Fifth Master,

841
00:40:52,199 --> 00:40:53,079
let them fight!

842
00:41:42,119 --> 00:41:43,840
We won!

843
00:41:46,119 --> 00:41:47,320
Take that!

844
00:41:48,559 --> 00:41:49,320
Boss Cao,

845
00:41:49,559 --> 00:41:50,840
this Dragon-Soaring General

846
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:52,119
is truly extraordinary.

847
00:41:52,119 --> 00:41:53,800
It's won several rounds in a row.

848
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:54,719
Truly incredible!

849
00:41:54,719 --> 00:41:56,559
Miss Jiang, only you could bring such luck!

850
00:41:56,840 --> 00:41:57,880
You're my lucky charm.

851
00:41:57,880 --> 00:41:58,920
The moment you stood here,

852
00:41:58,920 --> 00:41:59,599
right here,

853
00:41:59,599 --> 00:42:01,159
I've been wiping the floor with him!

854
00:42:02,360 --> 00:42:03,280
You flatter me.

855
00:42:03,559 --> 00:42:04,920
I should thank you instead

856
00:42:04,920 --> 00:42:05,960
for helping me vent my anger.

857
00:42:08,159 --> 00:42:09,800
Fifth Master, go on and bite!

858
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,400
Come on, bite again!

859
00:42:16,880 --> 00:42:18,079
Are you an idiot? Get on your knees!

860
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:19,880
Kneel down, now!

861
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:32,360
I'm done playing.

862
00:42:38,239 --> 00:42:39,280
Clear out, everyone.

863
00:42:40,199 --> 00:42:41,400
Go back and talk some sense into him.

864
00:42:41,840 --> 00:42:42,760
What are you...

865
00:42:43,800 --> 00:42:44,440
This whole mess...

866
00:42:45,559 --> 00:42:46,199
Well...

867
00:42:46,199 --> 00:42:47,679
What a pity about the Xuande jar.

868
00:42:48,159 --> 00:42:49,440
Boss Cao, it's fine.

869
00:42:49,639 --> 00:42:51,159
I'll go out and talk to him.

870
00:42:51,599 --> 00:42:52,519
Go ahead.

871
00:42:58,400 --> 00:42:59,800
Fifth Master, calm down.

872
00:43:02,519 --> 00:43:03,920
What a massive temper.

873
00:43:04,360 --> 00:43:05,559
Wearing that hat,

874
00:43:05,639 --> 00:43:07,159
short as he is,

875
00:43:07,440 --> 00:43:08,960
using the hat to look taller?

876
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:10,840
"Fifth Master"?

877
00:43:11,719 --> 00:43:13,239
And I'm your Second Brother!

878
00:43:13,679 --> 00:43:14,960
I'll bite your head off!

879
00:43:16,079 --> 00:43:18,079
Why am I so happy today?

880
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:24,679
Where's my General?

881
00:44:43,280 --> 00:44:44,400
Benefactor,

882
00:44:44,639 --> 00:44:45,920
what you see may not be real,

883
00:44:46,280 --> 00:44:47,559
yet what you see is truth.

884
00:44:47,719 --> 00:44:49,079
If you wish to peer into the mystery,

885
00:44:49,199 --> 00:44:51,159
the hidden dragon shall reveal itself.

886
00:44:51,559 --> 00:44:52,920
This con

887
00:44:52,920 --> 00:44:54,440
is called the Golden Hook Trap.

888
00:44:54,800 --> 00:44:56,000
The Golden Hook Trap...

889
00:44:56,280 --> 00:44:57,360
She's trying to hook me.

890
00:44:57,360 --> 00:44:58,079
She hooks me,

891
00:44:58,079 --> 00:44:59,159
and I'll turn her into a human-dog.

892
00:44:59,880 --> 00:45:00,920
You've just

893
00:45:00,920 --> 00:45:02,159
planted a desire in his mind.

894
00:45:02,440 --> 00:45:03,599
When the Heavenly Fate Sect runs a con,

895
00:45:03,840 --> 00:45:05,039
isn't it all about

896
00:45:05,440 --> 00:45:07,360
planting desires in people's hearts?

897
00:45:07,440 --> 00:45:10,480
Long live the Emperor, long live His Majesty!
